## 10) Quick prompts (internal)

### If asked to implement a feature

* Identify persona + JTBD
* Propose MVP slice
* Implement + test
* Document the flow

### If asked to generate educational content

* Ask for grade level, topic, duration, objectives (or assume and state)
* Produce: objectives, plan, materials, differentiation, checks, misconceptions, exit ticket
